{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（9日）下午2時許，警方在旺角洗衣街近亞皆老街截查一輛可疑的士，人員在車內搜證；一名男子被戴上手銬、黑布蒙頭，在場受查。警員帶走證物，緝毒犬亦同召到場。</p><p>現場所見，警員用膠索帶圍封一輛「小露寶」的士，人員打開車尾箱及車門調查。一名穿間條衫、拖鞋的男子，被黑布蒙頭鎖上手銬，站在一旁受查。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方在旺角洗衣街近亞皆老街截查一輛可疑的士，一名男子黑布蒙頭上手扣受查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185240582885478400741983.jpeg/z8Da_nUUc0QpnGu0N07VJO5Ry5wuLPSQGvOKpzDziqc\"/><figcaption>警方在旺角洗衣街近亞皆老街截查一輛可疑的士，一名男子黑布蒙頭上手扣受查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員檢獲證物。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185240585637072896641029.jpeg/hyXo8ku6rTp7RfIiOYBY4QPF4qysfH77b9860EXfOtA\"/><figcaption>警員檢獲證物。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名穿間條衫、拖鞋的男子，被黑布蒙頭鎖上手銬，站在一旁受查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185240580121300992239546.jpeg/5sLslGAkHtAoFLNJB_6gkmm84p4PeP9EgiGbqqghm6o\"/><figcaption>一名穿間條衫、拖鞋的男子，被黑布蒙頭鎖上手銬，站在一旁受查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"緝毒犬同召到場搜證。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185240577361317888389546.jpeg/gSQrVLCv4vpaNQGdor4251f-uvGGynzPkcnDHpHJwx4\"/><figcaption>緝毒犬同召到場搜證。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185233361908797440120398.jpeg/YfxKrG3OnpdDIzD2aJEJGZUKkNYKoFOzXvV-tl71frY\"/><figcaption>（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查，一名男子（右二）黑布蒙頭被戴上手扣。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185233356892147712892740.jpeg/CEnAwRU0n5LXDMVJIWBNrICsSNPDxWhsVRHSMlUR0jI\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查，一名男子（右二）黑布蒙頭被戴上手扣。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185233359283032064579806.jpeg/nhWWmsOz23bAMoAOSO8EnCuL4T508WuQ5kbGZeZGxmU\"/><figcaption>（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185233356892147712892740.jpeg/CEnAwRU0n5LXDMVJIWBNrICsSNPDxWhsVRHSMlUR0jI\"/><figcaption>（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185233225341997056260458.jpeg/m9H1zhSLNqwvPxnXSallDMKMzHRhYOsLFLJF2RSyRdk\"/><figcaption>（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T06:58:45.456517+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":316,"images":9,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}